### 2. Enhanced `syncToBackend()` — [background.js](file:///c:/Users/abhib/Downloads/distraction-extension-v4%20(1)/extension/background.js#L293-L340)

**Critical fix**: The old version spread `liveData` without a `sessionId`. PHP had to reverse-engineer the session ID from `timestamp - (sessionDuration * 60000)` which is inherently imprecise. Now `sessionId: state.startTime` is injected explicitly.

**Debug logging**: Every sync cycle now logs what it's sending (sessionId, DLS, tier, feature count) and whether the POST succeeded or failed.

