### 6. ML Retraining Loop — [train_model.py](file:///c:/Users/abhib/Downloads/distraction-extension-v4%20(1)/ml-training/train_model.py#L152-L235)

New `load_real_data()` function that:
1. Looks for `ml-training/real_training_data.json`
2. Parses the PHP `/api/training-data` JSON format
3. Extracts all 13 features in the exact ONNX feature order
4. If ≥100 real samples: weighs them 3x and merges with synthetic data
5. If <100 samples: appends without weighting
6. If no file found: uses synthetic only (existing behavior)

