## Data Flow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Ext as Chrome Extension<br/>(background.js)
    participant PHP as PHP Backend<br/>(XAMPP)
    participant DB as MySQL<br/>(studyguard)
    participant ML as train_model.py

    Note over Ext: Session starts
    Ext->>PHP: POST /api/session/register<br/>{sessionId, startTime}
    PHP->>DB: INSERT INTO sessions

    loop Every 60 seconds (alarm)
        Ext->>Ext: extractFeatures() → 13 features
        Ext->>Ext: computeDLS() → ONNX inference
        Ext->>PHP: POST /api/session/snapshot<br/>{sessionId, currentDLS, features{...13}}
        PHP->>DB: INSERT INTO snapshots (13 cols)
        PHP->>DB: UPSERT sessions (aggregates)
        PHP-->>Ext: {ok: true}
        Ext->>PHP: GET /api/model/weights
        PHP-->>Ext: {weights: {...}}
    end

    Note over Ext: Session ends
    Ext->>PHP: POST /api/session/complete<br/>{sessionId, endTime}
    PHP->>DB: UPDATE sessions SET end_time

    Note over ML: Retraining (manual)
    ML->>PHP: GET /api/training-data
    PHP->>DB: SELECT 13 features + dls + label
    PHP-->>ML: {count, data: [...5000]}
    ML->>ML: Merge real + synthetic data
    ML->>ML: Train GradientBoosting
    ML->>Ext: Save dls_model.onnx
```

