### Step 6: Verify Debug Log
- [ ] Open `C:\xampp\htdocs\studyguard\debug.log`
- [ ] Each line shows the incoming payload metadata

### Step 7: End Session & Check Complete
- [ ] End the session in the extension
- [ ] Console shows: `[Finalize] Session ... completed ✓`
- [ ] phpMyAdmin → sessions → `end_time` is now populated

### Step 8: Dashboard
- [ ] Open the extension dashboard
- [ ] Backend badge should show "✅ Backend: Online"
- [ ] DB Sessions and Snapshots counts should be non-zero

